      "level": 10,
      "parent": "G06F5/10",
      "ja": "充填度を監視する手段；衝突，即ち，同時に格納および取り出しを行う際のコンフリクト，を解消する手段",
      "en": "Means for monitoring the fill level; Means for resolving contention, i.e. conflicts between simultaneous enqueue and dequeue operations",
