      "parent": "G06F2203/041",
      "ja": "デジタイザー内の複数回タッチ，すなわち，複数の接触位置の同時検出についての細部，例．複数の指またはペンおよび１本の指",
      "en": "Multi-touch detection in digitiser, i.e. details about the simultaneous detection of a plurality of touching locations, e.g. multiple fingers or pen and finger",
