      "code": "G06F2203/04802",
      "level": 9,
      "parent": "G06F2203/048",
      "ja": "３Ｄ情報オブジェクト：情報は３次元操作可能オブジェクトの内部または外部表面上に表示される，例．ユーザーによって回転可能なキューブの表面上",
      "en": "3D-info-object: information is displayed on the internal or external surface of a three dimensional manipulable object, e.g. on the faces of a cube that can be rotated by the user",
